        "question_text": "<p>Which of the following is a key difference between <b>Neoclassicism</b> and <b>Romanticism</b>?</p>",
        "question_image": null,
        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p><b>Neoclassicism</b> emphasized order, symmetry, and rationality, drawing inspiration from classical antiquity. In contrast, <b>Romanticism</b> focused on emotion, individualism, and the sublime, often depicting dramatic and exotic subjects.</p>",
